","other_kind":"paper","other_layer":"update","other_name":"Lost in the Middle: How Language Models Use Long Contexts","other_name_zh":"中间信息丢失","other_occurred_at":"2023-07-06","other_slug":"lost-in-the-middle-how-language-models-use-long-contexts","other_summary":"发现长上下文中相关信息位于中部时，模型利用效果明显变差。","rationale":"堆入更多检索段落时，中间位置的证据可能被忽视。","sources":[{"quote":null,"title":"Lost in the Middle: How Language Models Use Long Contexts","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2307.03172"}],"type":"challenges","valid_from":null,"valid_to":null}]}